DreamUITooltipSubsystem:ShowTooltipFor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUITooltip.h#DreamUITooltipSubsystem:ShowTooltipFor
    src   "Show InSource's tooltip right now, to the player who owns InSource, as though its dwell had just elapsed.\nDoes nothing for a source that offers neither ToolTipText nor a tooltip widget class."
    text  "立即向拥有InSource的玩家显示InSource的工具提示，就像其停留计时刚刚到期一样。\n对于既不提供ToolTipText也不提供工具提示控件类的源，此操作不做任何事。"
    state machine
}

